{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"THEi高科院呈獻：創科著陸 - 實戰方程式｜智慧出行　都會實驗\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/APP-THEI-POWERMAN-261121.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】香港正朝道路零排放的目標進發，電動車及充電的需求日益增加。有學生團隊研發移動式充電機械人，打破傳統車主到處找固定充電樁的局限。學界創科如何跟業界緊密聯繫，配合社會實際需要？</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T01:21:06.706908+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T01:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T08:37:13.506329+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T01:14:25.458994+00:00","content_hash":"e642a5b63594c15e32f22680172c7a6d8a5c8928e6c97d160a4571169b8d73ee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T01:21:06.706908+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}